    <p>But most booking platforms are built for the US market. They price in USD, offer no French language support, and do not understand Canadian tax rules or business culture. Canadian businesses in Quebec face an additional challenge: provincial language regulations mean your client-facing tools need to work in French. A booking system that only speaks English fails half your clientele in Montreal, Quebec City, and Gatineau.</p>

